 {tab==="evidence"&&<><PageHead eyebrow="SCIENTIFIC TRACEABILITY" title="Evidence centre" sub="Start with authoritative datasets. Each source has a distinct scope; inspect its methodology, version, coverage and licensing before using records."/><div className="evidence-banner"><div className="evidence-orb"><Database size={30}/></div><div><span className="eyebrow">RESEARCH STANDARD</span><h2>Every claim needs a trail.</h2><p>Capture source URL, publication or update date, record identifier, coordinate precision, commodity, deposit type and confidence basis for each geological claim.</p></div></div><div className="source-grid">{sources.map((s,i)=><article className="panel source-card" key={s.name}><div className="source-number">0{i+1}</div><h3>{s.name}</h3><p>{s.purpose}</p><a href={s.url} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Open source <ChevronRight size={14}/></a></article>)}</div><section className="panel evidence-checklist"><div className="panel-head"><div><h3><Database size={17}/> Connected source registry</h3><p>BGS supports live API import. USGS and World Mining Data files are staged for explicit mapping and review.</p></div><span className="count-chip">{intelligenceSources.length} SOURCE CONNECTORS</span></div><div className="ingestion-toolbar"><div><b>Live import: BGS World Mineral Statistics</b><p>Imports production observations only; BGS API archive currently reports 1970–2022. First run may take several minutes.</p></div><button className="primary-btn" disabled={syncing||apiStatus!=="online"} onClick={runBgsSync}>{syncing?"Syncing BGS…":"Import BGS production"}</button></div>{ingestionState&&<div className="notice compact"><ShieldCheck size={16}/><div><b>BGS import: {ingestionState.status}</b><p>{ingestionState.records_seen||0} records inspected · {ingestionState.records_added||0} records added. {ingestionState.error||ingestionState.details?.warning||""}</p></div></div>}<div className="source-grid">{intelligenceSources.map((src,i)=><article className="panel source-card" key={src.id}><div className="source-number">0{i+1}</div><h3>{src.publisher}</h3><p><b>{src.dataset}</b></p><p>{src.integration}</p><small>{(src.themes||[]).join(" · ")}</small><a href={src.url} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Open dataset <ChevronRight size={14}/></a></article>)}</div>{intelligenceQuality&&<div className="notice compact"><ShieldCheck size={16}/><div><b>Evidence registry: {intelligenceQuality.observation_count} observations</b><p>{intelligenceQuality.missing_data_year} missing reporting years · {intelligenceQuality.missing_methodology} missing methodology descriptions. {intelligenceQuality.rules?.join(" ")}</p></div></div>}</section><section className="panel evidence-checklist"><h3><ShieldCheck size={17}/> Minimum evidence record</h3><div className="check-grid">{["Source and dataset version","Publication / update date","Record identifier and licence","Coordinates and precision","Commodity and deposit type","Grade / resource class, if reported","Depth range, only if reported","Confidence and limitations"].map(x=><div key={x}><span>✓</span>{x}</div>)}</div></section><div className="notice"><BookOpen size={18}/><div><b>Evidence status vocabulary</b><p><strong>Verified occurrence</strong> = source-backed occurrence record. <strong>Estimated resource</strong> = formally reported estimate with classification. <strong>Predicted prospect</strong> = modelled target, not a discovery. <strong>Theoretical alternative</strong> = research candidate, not proven commercial replacement.</p></div></div></>}
